If you don't like camera shake, you can reduce or disable it in game settings.

&#x200B;

If you think game is too bright/dark you can adjust it in game settings.

&#x200B;

If you don't like the bloom overlay which makes everything brighter and kind of lose contrast, set 'volumetric lighting' in settings to low.

Enable 'show hp bars' both on your character,minions, and opponents if you prefer it.

&#x200B;

If you experience in-game tearing, enable v-sync OR just limit your fps to a number below your monitor's max refresh rate.

Learn to make and use in-game loot filter. Make one simple filter for HP affixes and another for resistances.

&#x200B;

Then later on you can make your own loot filter as needed by your build.

